-- Platinum and AA sinks (generated by utils/scripts/rift/gen_sinks.py; edit that, not this)
-- Chronal Tributes 60-63 (items 980001-980035), Paragon AAs (abilities 17800+, ranks 19000+),
-- the Chronal Artificer (npc 1200050) in The Void. Rerunnable. Needs shared_memory and a zone restart.
-- Paragon of Vitality: +25 hit points/rank, 50 ranks, 5-54 AA/rank, 1,475 AA total
-- Paragon of the Mind: +25 mana/rank, 50 ranks, 5-54 AA/rank, 1,475 AA total
-- Paragon of Stamina: +25 endurance/rank, 50 ranks, 5-54 AA/rank, 1,475 AA total
-- Paragon of Fortitude: +1 armor class/rank, 50 ranks, 5-54 AA/rank, 1,475 AA total
-- Paragon of Might: +1 attack/rank, 50 ranks, 5-54 AA/rank, 1,475 AA total
-- Paragon of Ferocity: +1% melee damage/rank, 10 ranks, 25-115 AA/rank, 700 AA total
-- Paragon of Strength: +1 Heroic Strength/rank, 50 ranks, 15-162 AA/rank, 4,425 AA total
-- Paragon of Endurance: +1 Heroic Stamina/rank, 50 ranks, 15-162 AA/rank, 4,425 AA total
-- Paragon of Agility: +1 Heroic Agility/rank, 50 ranks, 15-162 AA/rank, 4,425 AA total
-- Paragon of Dexterity: +1 Heroic Dexterity/rank, 50 ranks, 15-162 AA/rank, 4,425 AA total
-- Paragon of Intellect: +1 Heroic Intelligence/rank, 50 ranks, 15-162 AA/rank, 4,425 AA total
-- Paragon of Wisdom: +1 Heroic Wisdom/rank, 50 ranks, 15-162 AA/rank, 4,425 AA total

